8)  had the nginx /api issue (important)


Problem

When running production frontend in Docker, nginx serves React.

If nginx is not configured to proxy /api/*, then:

GET /api/anything returns React index.html (SPA fallback)

POST /api/copilot/ask returns 405 (nginx rejects POST to static)

That’s why Copilot was failing even though other GET endpoints looked “fine”.

Fix

 needed nginx config:

/api/* → proxy to backend

everything else → React SPA

This is exactly how production SPAs work.

9) CORS issue (why it happened)

After fixing some routing, you tested with frontend calling:

http://localhost:8080/api/copilot/ask

That is cross-origin (5173 vs 8080), so browser sends OPTIONS preflight.

 backend initially returned:

403 on OPTIONS → browser blocks request → CORS error

 fixed it by allowing CORS and preflight requests in Spring Security.

10) Copilot AI design (the correct architecture)

